<span style="display: inline-flex; align-self: flex-start; background: #3CA8E4; color: #0A0A12; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px">Legal</span>
<span style="font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; color: #F4F3F8">No offside</span>
<span style="color: #C9C8D8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">An attacker can wait behind the last defender and receive a pass. There is no offside, as long as they stay out of the zone.</span>
<span style="color: #3CA8E4; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px">Play on</span>
</figcaption>
